name: sim.setShapeBB
description: Sets the size of a shape's bounding box, effectively scaling the shape. Non-isometric scaling is not always possible
luaSynopsis: sim.setShapeBB(int shapeHandle, list size)
pythonSynopsis: sim.setShapeBB(int shapeHandle, float[3] size)
inputs:
1. shapeHandle: handle of the shape
2. size: size of the bounding box
outputs:
replacedBy:
- name: alignBoundingBox, class: shape, file: shape_alignBoundingBox.method
